{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"承接S01-5已经出现但尚未经过思考的前进冲动，并把它写成尚未踏实就先承担的心理转变，没有新增具体事件或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不甘心认输、行动带来的力量与骄傲、仍不相信自己能改变什么，都是对行动与疑虑并存的心理概括，没有把珠子的比喻写成真实事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得什么尚未说清、承担之后不敢相信还能保住珍惜之物，既承接前段的牵挂，也解释了珠子中的失落感，没有具体化为某件物品或某段往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“反复劝自己没事”把B4中“像反复对自己说‘我没事’”的音乐表现比喻落实成了他实际进行的自我对白，超出了心理概括的边界。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-4已经写明他为自己非得想透才肯走而难堪，这能推动他转而不等心里踏实就先行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-5明确写出身体已经有了向前的冲动，直接解释了S02-1为什么会顺着冲动承担起来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-1中不肯就此算了的劲头，延续成S02-2中不甘心认输的心理动力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-2已经提出真正投入可能失去舍不得的东西，S02-3将这份担忧推进到实际承担之后不敢相信还能照旧留住它们。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-5能解释他仍说不清自己究竟在意什么，但不能单独解释他为什么不敢相信承担之后还能留住珍惜之物，后半层因果主要来自S01-2。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从顺着冲动承担，到获得力量却仍不信自己，再到牵挂与失去之忧浮现、努力稳住自己而无法安心的过程，前段也交代了冲动的来源。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R6\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“从前总问值不值，如今只说愿尽力”这一明确的前后转变没有完整保留下来；修补版写了不等心里踏实就行动，也写了接下自己能做的一份，但没有明确呈现从反复权衡值不值得转向愿意尽力的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“反复劝自己没事”与“急着把自己撑住”都在写努力稳住自己，前者可以删去而不损失后面的牵挂与不安，也避免把B4的比喻落实成实际自我对白。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b13d382-103e-46fe-9598-823cd56ecee5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T051424147753Z", "elapsed_seconds": 186.782, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:17:30.933014+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a0bcad1f618a1f77a13fc9cf703d305acadcfb300f14d9b8a18af385c7a826b1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T051424147753Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f429722c02e1c4e0f82dc237d45c35b0d62dcb3300d436e4c3861fa2bb1b53ff"}}}
